  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_AuditoriaRevelaViesAlgoritmico
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Auditoria Revela Vi\xE9s Algor\xEDtmico"
  _titleEn: Audit Reveals Algorithmic Bias
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Algoritmos treinados com dados do passado podem repetir e ampliar discrimina\xE7\xF5es,
    sem que ningu\xE9m perceba."
  _summaryEn: Algorithms trained on past data can repeat and amplify discrimination
    without anyone noticing.
  _realWorld: "Na Holanda, um sistema usado para apontar fraudes em aux\xEDlios para
    creche acusou injustamente milhares de fam\xEDlias, muitas de origem estrangeira;
    o esc\xE2ndalo derrubou o governo em 2021."
  _realWorldEn: In the Netherlands, a system used to flag childcare benefit fraud
    wrongly accused thousands of families, many of foreign origin; the scandal brought
    down the government in 2021.
  _tradeOffs: "Auditar os algoritmos, explicar as decis\xF5es e manter uma pessoa
    respons\xE1vel pela revis\xE3o evita injusti\xE7as."
  _tradeOffsEn: Auditing algorithms, explaining decisions and keeping a person accountable
    for review prevents injustice.
  _sources:
  - Label: Dutch childcare benefits scandal (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_childcare_benefits_scandal
